save has_talked_once = 0
save west_quest_completed = false
extern has_needed_item
extern give_reward()
Oh!
if has_talked_once < 1
	A Shadowtail!
	You mean we did not all fail!?
	Dying was a shock to me, but so was coming back as a ghost! It's nice to get one last chance to wish the Shadowtail good luck!
	What can I help you with?
else
	What can I help you with?
set has_talked_once = 1
if has_needed_item
	Would you look at that! That's my Heart, isn't it? I shouldn't be surprised, with a smart Shadowtail such as yourself in here, helping set things right!
	Thank you! With my Heart back, I can pass on my remaining life essence to you, and that should ease your passage through these skulking shadows.
	give_reward()
	set west_quest_completed = true
- Quest!
	if not west_quest_completed
		Where are my manners? I should give my remaining life essence to you so that you will have an easier time traversing this dungeon!
		Alas, my Heart got locked up in one of those Spirit Cages, and we'll need 3 Artifacts of Meaning to get it out. Any 3 will unlock the gates!
		If you can get me my Heart back, the increase to your heatlh is yours!
		And if you survive the dungeon, maybe you'll live an even heartier life than I did! Ho ho.
		Oh! And the Spirit Cage my Heart is trapped in - it's... to the left there, over that very old ledge that has started to fall away. PLEASE be very careful if you walk over there...    
	else
		You are going to do wonderful things! Thank you again for restoring my Heart.
- Learn about Artifacts
	- Artifact 1: Tea Pot
		For generations, the Chipmunks took great care of us woodland folk. -And we needed their help! Without a strong, sturdy structure like the one we're standing in, the winters are hard.
		-I just realized! You're the only one of us who is standing! Ho ho!
		Anyhow! The Burrowbrood clan of Chipmunks toiled to provide us great feasts, in winter even! Can you believe that? We took them for granted...
		I don't know which of them turned on us. But I know I'd have done things differently if I'd known how upset the Chipmunks had become. They call themselves Dartmunks now... Watch out for -you guessed it! Their DARTS! Ho ho! Took one to the side. Then another.
		They're powerful if you let them get on top of you.
		...Somewhere in this maze that the rodent clans lived in, I am so sure I saw one of those old Burrowbrood tea pots, from before... From a... From a happier time. What a nice tea pot it was...
	- Artifact 2: Water Spout
		I've seen hints that before this place was turned into a fortress for the rodent folk to live in, the Ancients took great care in making this place beautiful. 
		Somewhere in here is one of their old water spouts - but it's not like a tap that you or I might make. This has decorations along it and two wings on top. The Ancients seemed to think even a water tap was worth making artfully. I admire that.
	- Artifact 3: Cushion
		The Rat king of the Pawsticks once sat on a VERY comfortable looking throne.
		The Chipmunks threw out all of the old reminders of the Pawsticks' opulence when they took over.
		But Shadowtail, I believe one of those comfy cushions... might just be around here still. I know that I cannot feel pain anymore, so I can't benefit from that cushion... but it sure seems a shame to let such a comfy pillow go to waste!
- Learn about Ghosts
	- Ghost of the West (Me!)
		I'm great!
		Hahaha!
		Well! At least I THINK I'm great, ho ho!
		You might have guessed that I was a sort of... unusual Shadowtail. I didn't QUITE fit in with our great and noble order, ho ho.
		But it was a good life, living among the Shadowtail. Sometimes I think I was the only one who saw you as Squirrels and not just TOOLS for WAR! HA!
		Perhaps, if you survive this place... you can decide for yourself what the Shadowtails will stand for...
		I- I do believe... you are the only one - the LAST Shadowtail... It may stand to you to decide whether our order continues if you survive this. -And if you continue our order... what choices might you make that will lead you to a better life than we led each other to?
	- Ghost of the East
		The Ghost of the East... hmm... how to say this... The Ghost of the East... needs to drink some tea and calm down... Ho ho!
	- Ghost of the Entrance
		My mentor. A sad death.
		I-
		Please, Shadowtail... I cannot speak of this death...
- No
	Maybe next time, pardner!
